+/**
+ * Runs charged to the bowler for delivery `d`: off the bat, plus wides, plus one run per no-ball.
+ * Byes, leg-byes and penalty runs are not charged.
+ *
+ * The warehouse's is_bye / is_legbye / is_penalty flags are 0 on every row (the ingest never set them),
+ * so the earlier `total_runs - extras-when-flagged` expression charged every bye and leg-bye to the
+ * bowler: 7,142 runs across IPL history. This uses only populated columns. It equals the Cricsheet
+ * definition (batter + wides + no-balls) except on 17 deliveries the source records as multi-run
+ * no-balls or as a wide with penalty runs, where the warehouse cannot tell the components apart
+ * (30 runs net, 2008–2026).
+ */
+export const RUNS_CONCEDED_SQL =
+  "(d.batter_runs + CASE WHEN d.is_wide = 1 THEN d.extra_runs ELSE 0 END + CASE WHEN d.is_noball = 1 THEN 1 ELSE 0 END)";
+
